| Replay: runs the first job Mesa (riscos-mesa's V3DTri) sent, from the
| *V3DDump file MesaJob, as sent and with one change at a time, to find
| what makes the GPU stop. Nothing else should be using the GPU (the job
| needs its buffer addresses). Each run that hangs takes about 1.3 s.
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.15 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.V3DRender
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.15 Error V3DRender 0.15 didn't load
WimpSlot -min 24000K -max 24000K
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DJob replay <Obey$Dir>.MesaJob -o <Obey$Dir>.Results
